                  <provenance type="#e"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_425">Oxford, Oxfordshire.
                        All Souls' College</orgName><p>Erased inscr. legible by u. v. light:
                        'Liber collegii animarum omnium fidelium defunctorum in Oxonia ex dono
                        venerabilis viri Ricardi Bartlett in medicinis doctor et quondam huius
                        collegii socii' (s. xvi), at foot of 2nd leaf of the breviarium (fol. 12r).
                        Earlier at Abingdon, q. v.</p><p>Excluded from MLGB Suppl. (1987) since not
                        sure is All Souls until 1551.</p></provenance>
